'{% include %}' is deprecated in platformOS.

 → Replace: {% include 'x' %} → {% render 'x' %}
 → '{% render %}' has ISOLATED scope — variables from the parent template are NOT inherited.
 Pass every variable the partial needs explicitly:
 {% render 'partial', var1: value1, var2: value2 %}
